    description: "Observed in session_retrospective_04172026_1012.md Finding 3: vpr-usage was the joint-top injected playbook (6 injections) despite the vPR queue never being used this session and the remote being available throughout.\n\nProposed improvement: extend the PLAYBOOKS registry schema in .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py to allow optional precondition hints (e.g. 'only relevant when .git/PR_QUEUE is non-empty OR remote-unavailable errors present'). The selector reads these as gating conditions and skips inapplicable playbooks before spending tokens.\n\nStart with vpr-usage; apply to any other playbook whose relevance is state-conditional. Touches .agent/hooks/** -> needs_human_review."  # 8b35
